Local changes to the quickCapture plugin (hthienloc/dms-quick-capture), a DMS
plugin-manager clone that dots ignores, so an update or `dms plugins restore`
overwrites them. Made against d9e4475 (plugins.lock.json). Re-apply after an update:

  git -C ~/.config/DankMaterialShell/plugins/quickCapture apply ~/dots/DankMaterialShell/patches/quickCapture.patch

- Merging audio tracks and converting to GIF run with no timeout, so long recordings finish.
- Every saved recording is copied as a file:// link (text/uri-list), so Discord pastes the file and a GIF stays animated.

